tests.asserts:
Recommended new tests:
- the same href and pixels on card and detail;
- no filter, mix-blend-mode, object-fit cover or crop rules in the media sources;
- intrinsic width/height present;
- lazy loading on lists;
- an error swaps to the fallback, which resets when the descriptor changes;
- image absent, pending, rejected or broken leaves row count, price, action label, workflow mode and selectability identical;
- no per-card aria-live;
- no URL from a signed storage path, token or query is persisted in the sessionStorage draft.

